    <ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings>Alert settings</ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings>
    <ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowNoManagerAlert>Show an alert when no pawn has been assigned to managing</ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowNoManagerAlert>
    <ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowNoManagerAlert.Tip>Show an alert when a map has manager tasks configured, but no pawn has been assigned to managing, nor has an AI manager yet been built.</ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowNoManagerAlert.Tip>
    <ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowNoTableAlert>Show an alert when no manager building has been built</ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowNoTableAlert>
    <ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowNoTableAlert.Tip>Show an alert when a map has manager tasks configured, but no manager desk or AI manager has been built</ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowNoTableAlert.Tip>
    <ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowNoTableNeededAlert>Show an alert when manager desk is no longer needed</ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowNoTableNeededAlert>
    <ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowNoTableNeededAlert.Tip>Show an alert when a map has an AI manager, so manager desks are no longer needed</ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowNoTableNeededAlert.Tip>
    <ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowJobsNotUpdatingAlert>Show an alert when manager jobs are not updating</ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowJobsNotUpdatingAlert>
    <ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowJobsNotUpdatingAlert.Tip>Show an alert when manager jobs are not updating, which can happen if pawns assigned to managing are otherwise occupied with other things for too long or are otherwise incapacitated.</ColonyManagerRedux.ManagerSettings.AlertSettings.ShowJobsNotUpdatingAlert.Tip>
